@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Redmond, Washington: current conditions and seven-day forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/redmond
Accept: application/json

### Enns, Austria: current conditions and seven-day forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/enns
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported city: 404 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/london
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI (ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
